@example
```tsx
<DeploymentCard
deployment={deployment}
projectPath="/path/to/project"
onUpdate={() => updateDeployment(deployment.id)}
onRemove={() => removeDeployment(deployment.id)}
onViewSource={() => navigateToArtifact(deployment.artifact_name)}
/>
```
